# {{PROJECT}}: agent contract

Read this before changing anything. It applies to every coding agent and model family (Claude, Codex, Gemini, GLM, Grok, Kimi and others). Tool-specific files such as `CLAUDE.md` only import this one. If a tool does not read `AGENTS.md` by itself, point it here.

## Map

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Build plan, gates, open technical decisions | `specs/README.md` |
| Executable specs (one folder each), the spec template and the task ledger | `specs/NN-name/`, `specs/_template/`, `specs/LEDGER.md` |
| Guardrail hooks that enforce this contract | `tools/guardrails/` (start with its README) |
| Spec checker (format, wave overlap, readiness) | `tools/spec-check/` |
| Wave runner (a builder model builds one wave unattended) | `tools/build/` |
| The kit's settings: owner, reviewer bot, CI jobs, protected paths, deploy target, builders | `agentkit.config.json` |
| Status, progress log, decision records | `docs/STATUS.md`, `docs/log.md`, `docs/decisions/` |
